name: min-of-two-constants-is-a-value-not-a-window
why: The M28 compatibility guarantee the review pinned when it REJECTED a min(x, N) window overload: min(4, 2) is the number 2, never "a 2-sample window over 4". price - min(4, 2) is therefore price - 2 on every record: -1, 1, 3.
expr: nodeA.price - min(4, 2)
keys: nodeA.price
resolve: STRICT
--- LOG ---
---
#00:00:01.000 [t] INFO L
eventLogRecord:
  logTime: 1
  event: E
  nodeLogs:
    - nodeA: { price: 1.0}
---
#00:00:02.000 [t] INFO L
eventLogRecord:
  logTime: 2
  event: E
  nodeLogs:
    - nodeA: { price: 3.0}
---
#00:00:03.000 [t] INFO L
eventLogRecord:
  logTime: 3
  event: E
  nodeLogs:
    - nodeA: { price: 5.0}
--- EXPECT ---
1 => -1.0
2 => 1.0
3 => 3.0
